ars'>★★★★★ <span style='color:#6b7a78;font-weight:600'>(1,255)</span></div><h3><a href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Mexican-Style Yoga Blanket</a></h3><div class='price'>$22.95 <span class='was'>$29.95</span></div><span class='save'>6+ from $18.95</span><a class='btn full sm' style='margin-top:12px' href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Add to Cart</a></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb' style='background:#e6edf3'>⭕</div><div class='pc'><div class='stars'>★★★★☆ <span style='color:#6b7a78;font-weight:600'>(327)</span></div><h3><a href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Backbend Yoga Wheel, 12.5\\\"</a></h3><div class='price'>$39.95 <span class='was'>$54.95</span></div><span class='save'>Save 27%</span><a class='btn full sm' style='margin-top:12px' href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Add to Cart</a></div></div><div class='card'><span class='badge' style='background:#b1552b'>Best Value</span><div class='thumb' style='background:#eaf0e6'>📦</div><div class='pc'><div class='stars'>★★★★★ <span style='color:#6b7a78;font-weight:600'>(211)</span></div><h3><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio Starter Kit — 10 Mats, 20 Blocks, 10 Straps</a></h3><div class='price'>$429 <span class='was'>$648</span></div><span class='save'>Save $219 (34%)</span><a class='btn full sm alt' style='margin-top:12px' href='/wholesale.html'>See Kit Details</a></div></div></div><p class='center' style='margin-top:30px'><a class='btn ghost' href='/shop.html'>View all 340+ products →</a></p></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center'><div><span class='save'>For studios, schools, gyms &amp; events</span><h2>Bulk pricing that protects your margins</h2><p class='sub'>Because we manufacture our own goods, we can outfit a full studio for less than the cost of retail mats — with a dedicated rep, net-30 terms for approved accounts, and freight quotes in one business day.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Mat</th><th>You save</th></tr><tr><td>1–4</td><td>$24.95 ea</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>5–9</td><td>$21.95 ea</td><td>12%</td></tr><tr><td>10–24</td><td>$18.95 ea</td><td>24%</td></tr><tr><td>25+</td><td>$16.45 ea</td><td>34%</td></tr></table><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px'><a class='btn' href='/wholesale.html'>Request a Free Bulk Quote</a><a class='btn ghost' href='/contact.html'>Talk to a Studio Rep</a></div></div><div class='himg' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2f4f45,#8cbfb2)'>📦<div class='pill'>Trusted by 6,800+ studios &amp; schools</div></div></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='center'>What practitioners &amp; studio owners say</h2><p class='sub center'>4.8 average from 12,400+ verified reviews</p><div class='grid g3'><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>\\\"We've reordered mats for our studio three times now. They hold up to 20 classes a week and cost half what our old supplier charged.\\\"</p><div class='who'>Marisa T. — Studio Owner, Austin TX</div></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>\\\"Ordered Friday, practicing on it Monday. The 1/4\\\" mat is genuinely cushioned — my knees finally forgive me.\\\"</p><div class='who'>Dev P. — Verified Buyer</div></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>\\\"Outfitted 12 school classrooms with blocks, straps and mats. The rep quoted freight the same day and everything arrived early.\\\"</p><div class='who'>Karen L. — Wellness Coordinator</div></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center'><div class='himg' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b1552b,#e2a878);height:340px'>🕉️</div><div><h2>From our team of yoga lovers to you</h2><p style='font-size:17px;color:#42514f'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more.</p><p style='font-size:17px;color:#42514f'>We manufacture and source our own goods, which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice, but the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you — thank you.</p><a class='btn alt' href='/about.html'>More about YogaDirect →</a></div></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:760px'><h2 class='center'>Questions before you order?</h2><details class='faq'><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed before 1pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse — most customers receive their order in 2–5 business days. Bulk and freight orders ship within 1–3 business days.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>What if the mat isn't right for me?</summary><p>Return any unused item within 30 days for a full refund — no restocking fees. Every mat also carries a 1-year manufacturer warranty against defects.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do I get a discount for buying multiples?</summary><p>Yes. Volume pricing is applied automatically in the cart starting at 5 units, and saves up to 34% at 25+. Need 100+ or a custom logo print? <a href='/wholesale.html' style='color:#0f5c56;font-weight:700'>Request a bulk quote</a>.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Can you print our studio logo on mats?</summary><p>Absolutely. Custom logo printing is available on most mats and blocks with a 25-unit minimum. Ask your rep for artwork specs and lead times.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Is shipping really free?</summary><p>Yes — standard shipping is free on all US orders over $75. Orders under $75 ship for a flat $8.95.</p></details></div></section><section class='sec' style='background:#0f5c56;color:#fff'><div class='wrap center' style='max-width:640px'><h2 style='color:#fff'>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p style='color:#cfe4e0;font-size:17px'>Join 90,000+ practitioners for restock alerts, new arrivals and subscriber-only sales. One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p><form class='email' onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<p style=&quot;color:#ffd580;font-weight:700;margin:0&quot;>Thanks! Your code WELCOME10 is on its way to your inbox.</p>'\\\"><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn' type='submit'>Send My 10% Code</button></form></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='/index.html' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#7fb3a5'>Direct</span></a><p>Supplying the yoga community with manufacturer-direct mats and props since 1999.</p><p><strong style='color:#fff'>☎ 1-800-987-9642</strong><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET<br>help@yogadirect.com</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/shop.html'>Blocks &amp; Bricks</a><a href='/shop.html'>Straps &amp; Bolsters</a><a href='/shop.html'>Blankets</a><a href='/shop.html'>Studio Kits</a></div><div><h4>Wholesale</h4><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Pricing</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Custom Logo Printing</a><a href='/contact.html'>Request a Quote</a><a href='/contact.html'>Net-30 Accounts</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='/index.html#faq'>Shipping &amp; Delivery</a><a href='/index.html#faq'>30-Day Returns</a><a href='/about.html'>Our Story</a><a href='/contact.html'>Contact Us</a></div></div><p style='border-top:1px solid #243936;margin-top:30px;padding-top:18px;font-size:13px'>© 1999–2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. · Secure checkout with Visa, Mastercard, Amex, PayPal &amp; Shop Pay.</p></div></footer><div class='sticky'><div style='flex:1;font-size:13px;font-weight:7