0;font-size:14px'>✓ Added to cart. <a href='/shop.html' style='color:#0f5c56;text-decoration:underline'>Continue shopping</a> or check out securely.</div><ul class='ul'><li>Ships in 24 hrs from our US warehouse — arrives in 2–5 days</li><li>Free shipping on orders over $75</li><li>30-day returns, no restocking fee</li><li>1-year warranty against defects</li><li>Latex-free, phthalate-free, 6P-free</li></ul><div class='box'><strong>Buying for a studio, school or event?</strong> We can quote 50–5,000 units with custom colors and your logo printed on every mat. <a href='/wholesale.html' style='color:#0f5c56;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline'>Request a free bulk quote →</a> or call 1-800-987-9642.</div><p style='font-size:13px;color:#6b7a78;margin-top:14px'>🔒 Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Shop Pay</p></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g3'><div><h3>Specs</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>68\\\" x 24\\\" x 6mm (1/4\\\") · 3.4 lbs · high-density closed-cell PER foam · textured non-slip both sides · 12 colors.</p></div><div><h3>Best for</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>Hatha, restorative, gentle flow, pilates, knee-sensitive practice, studio rental fleets and event giveaways.</p></div><div><h3>Care</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>Wipe with our natural mat spray or mild soap and water. Hang to dry. Do not machine wash.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2>Complete your practice</h2><div class='grid g4'><div class='card'><div class='tb' style='background:#f3e7de'>🧱</div><div class='pc'><h3 style='font-size:15px'>Foam Block 4-Pack</h3><div style='font-weight:800'>$29.95</div><a class='btn full sm' style='margin-top:10px' href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Add</a></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tb' style='background:#eee7f0'>🎗️</div><div class='pc'><h3 style='font-size:15px'>8ft Cotton Strap</h3><div style='font-weight:800'>$9.95</div><a class='btn full sm' style='margin-top:10px' href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Add</a></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tb' style='background:#e8eef0'>🧴</div><div class='pc'><h3 style='font-size:15px'>Mat Cleaner Spray</h3><div style='font-weight:800'>$11.95</div><a class='btn full sm' style='margin-top:10px' href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Add</a></div></div><div class='card'><div class='tb' style='background:#f2eee6'>👜</div><div class='pc'><h3 style='font-size:15px'>Mat Sling &amp; Bag</h3><div style='font-weight:800'>$16.95</div><a class='btn full sm' style='margin-top:10px' href='/product-deluxe-mat.html'>Add</a></div></div></div><p style='font-size:14px;color:#6b7a78;margin-top:14px'>💡 Add $50.05 more to unlock free shipping.</p></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><h2>3,182 reviews · 4.8 average</h2><div class='grid g3' style='margin-top:20px'><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p style='font-size:15px'>\\\"Thick enough that I stopped folding a towel under my knees. Grippy even when I sweat.\\\"</p><strong style='font-size:14px'>Alina R. — Verified Buyer</strong></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p style='font-size:15px'>\\\"Bought 24 for our studio at the 10+ price. Two years of daily classes and they still look new.\\\"</p><strong style='font-size:14px'>Jon M. — Studio Owner</strong></div><div class='quote'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p style='font-size:15px'>\\\"Ordered Tuesday, on my floor Thursday, and no chemical smell at all. Exactly as described.\\\"</p><strong style='font-size:14px'>Priya S. — Verified Buyer</strong></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:760px'><h2>Common questions</h2><details class='faq'><summary>Is 1/4\\\" too thick for balance poses?</summary><p>For standing balance work, many teachers prefer our 1/8\\\" mat. If you practice restorative, gentle or knee-sensitive sequences, the 1/4\\\" is the more comfortable choice — and you can swap free within 30 days.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Does it smell when it arrives?</summary><p>A very slight new-foam scent may be present. Unroll and air out for 24 hours and it disappears. All mats are latex-free, phthalate-free and 6P-free.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Can you print our studio logo?</summary><p>Yes — single-color logo printing starts at 25 units. <a href='/wholesale.html' style='color:#0f5c56;font-weight:700'>Request a quote</a> and we'll send a digital proof.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>What's the return policy?</summary><p>30 days, unused, for a full refund — and we cover the label on defective items. No restocking fees, ever.</p></details></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='/index.html' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#7fb3a5'>Direct</span></a><p>Supplying the yoga community with manufacturer-direct mats and props since 1999.</p><p><strong style='color:#fff'>☎ 1-800-987-9642</strong><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET<br>help@yogadirect.com</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/shop.html'>Blocks &amp; Bricks</a><a href='/shop.html'>Straps &amp; Bolsters</a><a href='/shop.html'>Studio Kits</a></div><div><h4>Wholesale</h4><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Pricing</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Custom Logo Printing</a><a href='/contact.html'>Request a Quote</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='/index.html'>Shipping &amp; Delivery</a><a href='/index.html'>30-Day Returns</a><a href='/about.html'>Our Story</a><a href='/contact.html'>Contact Us</a></div></div><p style='border-top:1px solid #243936;margin-top:30px;padding-top:18px;font-size:13px'>© 1999–2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer><div class='sticky'><div style='flex:1;font-size:13px;font-weight:700'>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Mat<br><span style='color:#c04c14'>$24.95</span> <span style='color:#8b9795;text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:600'>$34.95</span></div><button class='btn sm' onclick=\\\"document.getElementById('added').style.display='block';window.scrollTo(0,300)\\\">Add to Cart</button></div><script>function upd(){var q=parseInt(document.getElementById('q').value),p=q>=25?16.45:q>=10?18.95:q>=5?21.95:24.95;document.getElementById('tot').textContent='$'+(q*p).toFixed(2);}</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/wholesale.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Yoga Wholesale &amp; Bulk Pricing for Studios | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Wholesale yoga mats, blocks and props direct from the manufacturer. Save up to 34%, custom logo printing, net-30 terms, dedicated rep. Free quote in 1 business day.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d2b2a;background:#fff;line-height:1.55}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.bar{background:#0f5c56;color:#fff;font-size:14px;text-align:center;padding:10px 12px}.bar strong{color:#ffd580}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e0d6}.hrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:13px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.logo span{color:#0f5c56}nav.main{display:flex;gap:22px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;margin-left:auto}.hact{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}.phone{color:#0f5c56}.mnav{display:none}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#e2703a;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:16px 28px;border-radius:8px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:17px;text-align:center}.btn:hover{background:#c85c29}.btn.alt{background:#0f5c56}.btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:#0f5c56;border:2px solid #0f5c56}.btn.sm{padding:10px 18px;font-size:14px}.btn.full{display:block;width:100%}h1{font-size: