lass='btn ghost' href='tel:18009879642'>☎ Call 1-800-987-9642</a></div><p style='font-size:13px;color:#6b7a78;margin-top:12px'>No commitment. Most quotes come back same day with freight included.</p></div><div class='form' id='quote'><h2 style='font-size:23px'>Get bulk pricing in 1 business day</h2><p style='font-size:14px;color:#4e5f5d;margin-top:0'>Tell us what you need — we'll send itemized pricing, freight and lead times.</p><form onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<h2 style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;>Thank you — your quote is in progress.</h2><p>A YogaDirect studio rep will email you within 1 business day. Need it faster? Call 1-800-987-9642 and mention a web quote request.</p>'\\\"><label>Name</label><input required placeholder='Jane Doe'><label>Business / studio name</label><input required placeholder='Riverbend Yoga'><label>Email</label><input type='email' required placeholder='jane@riverbendyoga.com'><label>Phone</label><input type='tel' placeholder='(555) 555-5555'><label>What do you need?</label><select><option>Yoga mats</option><option>Blocks &amp; bricks</option><option>Straps</option><option>Bolsters &amp; blankets</option><option>Full studio kit</option><option>Custom logo printing</option><option>Mixed / not sure yet</option></select><label>Estimated quantity</label><select><option>10–24 units</option><option>25–49 units</option><option>50–99 units</option><option>100–499 units</option><option>500+ units</option></select><label>Notes (colors, deadline, event date)</label><textarea rows='3' placeholder='Need 60 mats in forest green before Sept 1'></textarea><button class='btn full' style='margin-top:18px' type='submit'>Send My Free Quote Request</button><p style='font-size:12px;color:#6b7a78;text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>We never share your details. No spam, ever.</p></form></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='center'>Published volume pricing</h2><p class='sub center'>Discounts apply automatically in the cart. Need more than 100 units? Your rep can beat these numbers.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Product</th><th>1–4</th><th>5–9</th><th>10–24</th><th>25+</th></tr><tr><td>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</td><td>$24.95</td><td>$21.95</td><td>$18.95</td><td>$16.45</td></tr><tr><td>Foam Yoga Block (single)</td><td>$8.95</td><td>$7.75</td><td>$6.50</td><td>$5.45</td></tr><tr><td>8ft Cotton Strap</td><td>$9.95</td><td>$8.45</td><td>$6.95</td><td>$5.95</td></tr><tr><td>Rectangular Bolster</td><td>$44.95</td><td>$39.95</td><td>$35.95</td><td>$31.95</td></tr><tr><td>Yoga Blanket</td><td>$22.95</td><td>$20.45</td><td>$18.95</td><td>$16.95</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='center'>Ready-made studio kits</h2><p class='sub center'>Everything a room needs, bundled at our deepest published discount.</p><div class='grid g3'><div class='card'><h3>Starter Studio — 10 spots</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>10 Deluxe mats · 20 foam blocks · 10 straps</p><div style='font-size:26px;font-weight:800'>$429 <span style='color:#8b9795;text-decoration:line-through;font-size:17px'>$648</span></div><span style='background:#fdece2;color:#c04c14;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px'>Save $219</span><a class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px' href='#quote'>Request This Kit</a></div><div class='card' style='border:2px solid #0f5c56'><h3>Growth Studio — 25 spots</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>25 mats · 50 blocks · 25 straps · 12 blankets</p><div style='font-size:26px;font-weight:800'>$989 <span style='color:#8b9795;text-decoration:line-through;font-size:17px'>$1,562</span></div><span style='background:#fdece2;color:#c04c14;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px'>Save $573 · Most popular</span><a class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px' href='#quote'>Request This Kit</a></div><div class='card'><h3>Restorative Add-On</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>12 bolsters · 24 blankets · 24 cork blocks</p><div style='font-size:26px;font-weight:800'>$829 <span style='color:#8b9795;text-decoration:line-through;font-size:17px'>$1,224</span></div><span style='background:#fdece2;color:#c04c14;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:20px'>Save $395</span><a class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px' href='#quote'>Request This Kit</a></div></div></div></section><section class='sec sand'><div class='wrap'><h2 class='center'>Why studios reorder from us</h2><div class='grid g4' style='margin-top:22px'><div class='card'><h3>Since 1999</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>25+ years supplying the yoga community — one of the largest prop suppliers in the country.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>We're the maker</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>Manufacturing and sourcing our own goods keeps quality high and pricing consistent.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Stock you can count on</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>Deep US inventory so your reorder matches the mats already on your floor.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>Real humans</h3><p style='font-size:15px;color:#4e5f5d'>A named rep who knows your account, your colors and your budget cycle.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:760px'><h2>Wholesale FAQ</h2><details class='faq'><summary>Is there a minimum order?</summary><p>No minimum to get volume pricing online — discounts begin at 5 units. Custom logo printing requires 25 units per design.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do you offer net terms?</summary><p>Yes. Approved studios, schools, universities, hotels and municipalities can apply for net-30 terms. Ask your rep for the credit application.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>How is freight handled on large orders?</summary><p>Orders over roughly 20 mats usually ship LTL freight. We quote the exact freight cost up front with your itemized pricing — no surprises at checkout.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Can I get samples before committing?</summary><p>Yes. We'll send a single unit at cost so you can test density, grip and color before placing a full studio order.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do you sell to resellers and event planners?</summary><p>We do — retailers, corporate wellness programs, race and festival organizers, and hospitality groups all buy from us regularly.</p></details><p class='center' style='margin-top:30px'><a class='btn' href='#quote'>Request My Free Quote</a></p></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='/index.html' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#7fb3a5'>Direct</span></a><p>Supplying the yoga community with manufacturer-direct mats and props since 1999.</p><p><strong style='color:#fff'>☎ 1-800-987-9642</strong><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET<br>wholesale@yogadirect.com</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/shop.html'>Blocks &amp; Bricks</a><a href='/shop.html'>Straps &amp; Bolsters</a><a href='/shop.html'>Studio Kits</a></div><div><h4>Wholesale</h4><a href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Pricing</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Custom Logo Printing</a><a href='/contact.html'>Request a Quote</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='/index.html'>Shipping &amp; Delivery</a><a href='/index.html'>30-Day Returns</a><a href='/about.html'>Our Story</a><a href='/contact.html'>Contact Us</a></div></div><p style='border-top:1px solid #243936;margin-top:30px;padding-top:18px;font-size:13px'>© 1999–2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer><div class='sticky'><div style='flex:1;font-size:13px;font-weight:700'>Save up to 34% on bulk<br><span style='color:#6b7a78;font-weight:600'>Free quote in 1 business day</span></div><a class='btn sm' href='#quote'>Get Quote</a></div></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/about.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,i