r</span><a href='/products/deluxe-sticky-yoga-mat'><div class='thumb'><svg viewBox='0 0 100 60' fill='#3a5544'><rect x='6' y='18' width='88' height='24' rx='12'/></svg></div></a><div class='body'><div class='rate'><b>★★★★★</b> 4.8 (1,204)</div><h3><a href='/products/deluxe-sticky-yoga-mat'>1/4&quot; Deluxe Sticky Yoga Mat</a></h3><div class='price'>$19.95 <s>$26.95</s></div><div class='bulkline'>10+ mats: $16.95 each</div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-full add' data-n='Deluxe Sticky Yoga Mat'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><span class='tag g'>Best value</span><div class='thumb t2'><svg viewBox='0 0 100 60' fill='#b05a37'><rect x='10' y='16' width='36' height='28' rx='5'/><rect x='54' y='16' width='36' height='28' rx='5'/></svg></div><div class='body'><div class='rate'><b>★★★★★</b> 4.9 (863)</div><h3>Premium 4&quot; Foam Block — Pair</h3><div class='price'>$14.95 <s>$19.95</s></div><div class='bulkline'>10+ pairs: $11.95 each</div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-full add' data-n='Foam Block Pair'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb t3'><svg viewBox='0 0 100 60'><path d='M12 42c20-30 56-30 76 0' stroke='#4a4f78' stroke-width='7' fill='none'/></svg></div><div class='body'><div class='rate'><b>★★★★★</b> 4.7 (612)</div><h3>8ft Cotton Strap with D-Ring</h3><div class='price'>$9.95 <s>$12.95</s></div><div class='bulkline'>25+ straps: $6.95 each</div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-full add' data-n='Cotton Yoga Strap'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><span class='tag'>Low stock</span><div class='thumb t4'><svg viewBox='0 0 100 60' fill='#8a7550'><rect x='8' y='14' width='84' height='32' rx='16'/></svg></div><div class='body'><div class='rate'><b>★★★★★</b> 4.9 (417)</div><h3>Supportive Cotton Bolster</h3><div class='price'>$44.95 <s>$59.00</s></div><div class='bulkline'>10+ bolsters: $37.95 each</div><button class='btn btn-p btn-sm btn-full add' data-n='Cotton Bolster'>Add to cart</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class='bulk'><div class='wrap bulkg'><div><span class='eyebrow'>For studios, schools, gyms &amp; events</span><h2>Buy for your studio and save up to 40%</h2><p class='lead'>Tell us what you need and a real human sends a quote — usually within one business hour. Volume pricing, net terms for approved accounts, freight quotes and re-order reminders included.</p><ul style='font-size:16px;color:#3c4642;padding-left:20px'><li>No membership fee, no minimum order to get a quote</li><li>Free logo-printed mat options for events</li><li>Dedicated account manager for 25+ unit orders</li></ul><a href='/pages/wholesale' class='btn btn-p'>Request my bulk quote →</a></div><div><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Deluxe Sticky Mat</th><th>You save</th></tr><tr><td>1–9</td><td>$19.95 ea</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>10–24</td><td><b>$16.95 ea</b></td><td>15%</td></tr><tr><td>25–49</td><td><b>$14.50 ea</b></td><td>27%</td></tr><tr><td>50+</td><td><b>$11.95 ea</b></td><td>40%</td></tr></table><p style='font-size:13px;color:#6b7570;margin-top:12px'>Tiered pricing applies across mats, blocks, straps, bolsters and blankets. Mix and match to hit a tier.</p></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='shead'><div><h2>Ready-made kits (the easiest way to save)</h2><p>Pre-bundled at wholesale prices — one box, one shipment.</p></div></div><div class='kits'><div class='kit'><h3>Home Practice Kit</h3><div class='p'>$49.95</div><span class='save'>Save $17</span><ul><li>1/4&quot; Deluxe Sticky Mat</li><li>Pair of foam blocks</li><li>8ft cotton strap</li><li>Mat cleaner sample</li></ul><button class='btn btn-o btn-full add' data-n='Home Practice Kit'>Add kit to cart</button></div><div class='kit best'><h3>Studio Starter Kit — 10 students</h3><div class='p'>$449</div><span class='save'>Save $186 · Most popular</span><ul><li>10 × Deluxe Sticky Mats</li><li>10 × block pairs</li><li>10 × cotton straps</li><li>4 × cotton blankets</li><li>Free freight quote &amp; reorder plan</li></ul><button class='btn btn-p btn-full add' data-n='Studio Starter Kit'>Add kit to cart</button></div><div class='kit'><h3>Restorative Class Kit</h3><div class='p'>$629</div><span class='save'>Save $240</span><ul><li>8 × cotton bolsters</li><li>16 × cotton blankets</li><li>8 × eye pillows</li><li>Storage recommendations</li></ul><button class='btn btn-o btn-full add' data-n='Restorative Class Kit'>Add kit to cart</button></div></div><p style='text-align:center;margin-top:22px;color:#5c6661'>Need a custom kit? <a href='/pages/wholesale' style='color:#c96f4a;font-weight:700'>Ask for a tailored quote →</a></p></div></section><section style='background:#f7f4ef'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>4.8 out of 5 from 18,400+ verified buyers</h2><p style='text-align:center;color:#5c6661;margin-bottom:28px'>Studio owners, teachers and home practitioners since 1999.</p><div class='revs'><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;We&rsquo;ve outfitted three studios with YogaDirect mats. Three years in, they&rsquo;re still holding up through 40 classes a week. Nothing else at this price comes close.&rdquo;</p><b>Marisa T.</b><small>Studio owner, Austin TX</small></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;Ordered 60 mats and blocks for a corporate wellness event. Quote came back in under an hour and everything shipped the next day.&rdquo;</p><b>Devin R.</b><small>Event coordinator</small></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;The bolster is genuinely firm and the blankets are heavy cotton. I expected budget quality at these prices and got the opposite.&rdquo;</p><b>Angela K.</b><small>Yin &amp; restorative teacher</small></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='email'><div><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p>Join 90,000+ yogis for sequencing tips, restock alerts and members-only bulk deals. One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div><div><form class='sub' onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<p style=&quot;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin:0&quot;>✓ Check your inbox — your 10% code is on its way.</p>'\\\"><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn btn-p' type='submit'>Send my 10% code</button></form><small style='color:#cfdcd2'>Valid on orders over $49. New subscribers only.</small></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:10px'><div class='wrap faq'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Questions, answered</h2><details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed before 1pm ET ship the same or next business day from our US warehouse. Most orders arrive in 2–5 business days with tracked shipping. Freight orders (50+ mats) ship within 2 business days.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer wholesale or bulk pricing?</summary><p>Yes — tiered discounts start at just 10 units and reach up to 40% off at 50+. There&rsquo;s no membership fee and you can mix and match products to reach a tier. <a href='/pages/wholesale' style='color:#c96f4a;font-weight:700'>Request a quote here</a> and we typically respond within one business hour.</p></details><details><summary>What&rsquo;s your return policy?</summary><p>60 days from delivery on unused items, with no restocking fee. If a product fails in normal studio use, contact us and we&rsquo;ll make it right. Damaged or incorrect items are replaced free.</p></details><details><summary>Are your mats latex-free and phthalate-free?</summary><p>Our sticky mats are 6P-phthalate-free and latex-free. Full material specs, thickness, weight and care instructions are listed on every product page, and we&rsquo;re happy to send spec sheets for institutional purchasing.</p></details><details><summary>Can you print our studio or event logo?</summary><p>Yes. We offer custom-printed mats and towels for events, retreats and retail resale, typically on 50+ unit orders. Mention &ldquo;custom print&rdquo; in your quote request and we&rsquo;ll send artwork guidelines and pricing.</p></details></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fg'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fbb9f'>Direct</span></div><p style='margin-top:10px'>Supplying the yoga community with high-quality mats and props at direct prices since 1999. From our team of yoga lovers to you — thank you.</p><p><a href='tel:18005551234' style='color:#fff;font-weight:700'>1-800-555-1234</a><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/collections/all'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all'>Blocks &amp; wedges</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all'>Straps</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all'>Kits &amp; bundles</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Bulk &amp; studios</h4><ul><li><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Volume pricing tiers</a></li><li><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Custom logo printing</a></li><li><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Net terms</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/pages/contact'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='/pages/contact'>Shipping info</a></li><li><a href='/pages/contact'>Returns (60 days)</a></li><li><a href='/pages/about-us'>About YogaDirect</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><div class='pay'><span>VISA</span><span>MC</span><span>AMEX</span><span>PAYPAL</span><span>SHOP PAY</span><span>PO / NET 30</span></div></div></div></footer><div class='mcta'><a href='/pages/wholesale' class='btn btn-o btn-sm' style='flex:1'>Bulk quote</a><a href='/collections/all' class='btn btn-p btn-sm' style='flex:1.4'>Shop bestsellers</a></div><div id='toast'></div><script>function cc(){return parseInt(localStorage.getItem('yd_cart')||'0',10)}function rc(){document.querySelectorAll('.cart-n').forEach(function(e){e.textContent=