1–9</td><td>$19.95</td><td>—</td></tr><tr data-min='10' data-p='16.95'><td>10–24</td><td><b>$16.95</b></td><td>15%</td></tr><tr data-min='25' data-p='14.50'><td>25–49</td><td><b>$14.50</b></td><td>27%</td></tr><tr data-min='50' data-p='11.95'><td>50+</td><td><b>$11.95</b></td><td>40%</td></tr></table><div class='qrow'><div class='qty'><button onclick='step(-1)' aria-label='Decrease'>−</button><input id='q' value='1' inputmode='numeric'><button onclick='step(1)' aria-label='Increase'>+</button></div><button class='btn btn-p' style='flex:1' id='atc'>Add to cart — <span id='tot'>$19.95</span></button></div><div class='total' id='hint'>Add 9 more mats to unlock $16.95 each and save $27.</div><a href='/pages/wholesale' class='btn btn-o btn-full btn-sm'>Need 50+ or a custom logo print? Get a quote in 1 hour →</a><div class='reassure'><span>Free shipping on orders over $99 (add-ons count)</span><span>60-day returns — unused items, no restocking fee</span><span>Real humans on the phone: 1-800-555-1234, Mon–Fri 9–5 ET</span><span>Purchase orders &amp; net-30 terms for schools and studios</span></div></div></div></div><section><div class='wrap cols'><div><h2>Why teachers choose this mat</h2><ul style='font-size:16.5px;color:#3c4642;padding-left:20px'><li><b>Grip that lasts:</b> textured closed-cell surface keeps hands planted in sweaty flows and wipes clean in seconds.</li><li><b>6mm real cushion:</b> protects knees and wrists in low lunges and kneeling work — the most requested thickness by studios.</li><li><b>Studio durable:</b> dense PVC resists curling, cracking and heel dents through years of daily class use.</li><li><b>Easy to store:</b> lies flat immediately, stacks neatly on studio shelving, 2.2 lb so students carry it happily.</li></ul><p style='font-size:15px;color:#6b7570'>Care: wipe with our natural mat cleaner or mild soap and water. Air dry flat, out of direct sun.</p></div><div><h2>Specifications</h2><ul class='spec'><li><span>Dimensions</span><b>68&quot; × 24&quot;</b></li><li><span>Thickness</span><b>1/4&quot; (6mm)</b></li><li><span>Weight</span><b>2.2 lb</b></li><li><span>Material</span><b>Dense PVC, closed-cell</b></li><li><span>Safety</span><b>6P-phthalate &amp; latex free</b></li><li><span>Colours</span><b>5 studio colours</b></li><li><span>Warranty</span><b>1 year against defects</b></li><li><span>Ships from</span><b>US warehouse, 1 business day</b></li></ul></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2>Complete your practice — bundle and save 10%</h2><p style='color:#5c6661'>Frequently bought together with this mat.</p><div class='fbt'><div class='mini'><div class='th'></div><b>Premium 4&quot; Foam Blocks — pair</b><span style='color:#6b7570;font-size:14px'>$14.95 · 4.9★ (863)</span><button class='btn btn-o btn-sm add' data-n='Foam Block Pair'>Add</button></div><div class='mini'><div class='th' style='background:linear-gradient(140deg,#e9e9f2,#d8daea)'></div><b>8ft Cotton Strap with D-Ring</b><span style='color:#6b7570;font-size:14px'>$9.95 · 4.7★ (612)</span><button class='btn btn-o btn-sm add' data-n='Cotton Yoga Strap'>Add</button></div><div class='mini'><div class='th' style='background:linear-gradient(140deg,#e4eff2,#cfe2e8)'></div><b>Natural Mat Cleaner Spray</b><span style='color:#6b7570;font-size:14px'>$11.95 · 4.9★ (508)</span><button class='btn btn-o btn-sm add' data-n='Mat Cleaner Spray'>Add</button></div></div><div style='margin-top:18px;background:#f7f4ef;border:1px solid #e4ded4;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap'><div><b>Mat + blocks + strap + cleaner bundle</b><div style='color:#5c6661;font-size:14.5px'>$49.95 instead of $56.80 — free shipping when you add two bundles.</div></div><button class='btn btn-p add' data-n='Home Practice Kit'>Add bundle — $49.95</button></div></div></section><section id='reviews'><div class='wrap'><h2>1,204 reviews · 4.8 average</h2><div class='revs'><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;I bought 24 for our studio two years ago. Still no curling, still grippy. Ordering another 24 for the new room.&rdquo;</p><b>Marisa T.</b> <span style='color:#7b8580'>— Verified buyer</span></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;Thicker than the $60 mat I had before and my knees are much happier. Shipped in two days.&rdquo;</p><b>Jonah P.</b> <span style='color:#7b8580'>— Verified buyer</span></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>★★★★☆</div><p>&ldquo;Great grip once you rinse the surface. Colour is exactly as pictured and it lies flat right out of the box.&rdquo;</p><b>Renee C.</b> <span style='color:#7b8580'>— Verified buyer</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><h2>Shipping, returns &amp; bulk questions</h2><details open><summary>When will it arrive?</summary><p>Orders placed before 1pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse. Standard delivery is 2–5 business days; expedited options are shown at checkout. Orders of 50+ mats ship by freight within 2 business days.</p></details><details><summary>What if I don&rsquo;t like it?</summary><p>Return unused items within 60 days for a full refund — no restocking fee. If a mat fails in normal studio use within a year, we replace it.</p></details><details><summary>How do bulk discounts work?</summary><p>Tier pricing applies automatically in your cart, and you can mix mats, blocks, straps and blankets to reach a tier. For 50+ units, custom prints or net-30 terms, <a href='/pages/wholesale' style='color:#c96f4a;font-weight:700'>request a quote</a> — most come back within one business hour.</p></details><details><summary>Is this mat suitable for hot yoga?</summary><p>Yes — the closed-cell surface doesn&rsquo;t absorb sweat, which makes it hygienic for shared studio use. For very sweaty practices we recommend pairing it with a grip towel.</p></details></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fg'><div><div