ing &amp; Returns</a><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></nav><div class='hdr-cta'><a class='ph' href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><a class='btn btn-sm' href='/shop.html'>Shop Now</a><button class='burger' aria-label='Menu'>☰</button></div></div></header><div class='hero'><div class='wrap hero-in'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Manufacturer direct since 1999</div><h1>Studio-grade yoga mats &amp; props, without the studio-brand markup</h1><p class='lede'>We make and source our own gear, so teachers, studios, schools and home practitioners get gear that lasts — at prices retail can't touch. One of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country.</p><div class='cta-row'><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Shop Best Sellers →</a><a class='btn btn-o' href='/wholesale.html'>Get Bulk Pricing</a></div><ul class='ticks'><li>Ships in 1 business day</li><li>60-day easy returns</li><li>4.8/5 from 12,000+ reviews</li><li>Volume discounts from 6 units</li></ul></div><div class='hero-card'><div class='thumb t1'><span class='pill'>★ Best seller</span><span class='pill'>Save 24%</span></div><h3 style='margin-top:16px'>1/4&quot; Deluxe Sticky Yoga Mat</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ 4.8 <span>(2,140 reviews)</span></div><div class='price'>$24.95<span class='was'>$32.95</span></div><a class='btn' style='width:100%;padding:13px' href='/shop.html'>Add to Cart – $24.95</a><div class='stock'>In stock · Order by 2pm ET, ships today</div></div></div></div><div class='valuebar'><div class='wrap grid'><div>🏭 Direct from the manufacturer</div><div>🚚 Free shipping over $75</div><div>↩️ 60-day returns, no restocking fees</div><div>🧾 Studio, school &amp; event pricing</div></div></div><section><div class='wrap'><div class='sec-head'><h2>Shop by category</h2><p>Everything you need to outfit a practice or a whole studio floor.</p></div><div class='grid g6'><a class='cat' href='/shop.html'><div class='thumb t1'></div><p>Yoga Mats</p></a><a class='cat' href='/shop.html'><div class='thumb t3'></div><p>Blocks &amp; Wedges</p></a><a class='cat' href='/shop.html'><div class='thumb t4'></div><p>Straps &amp; Belts</p></a><a class='cat' href='/shop.html'><div class='thumb t2'></div><p>Bolsters &amp; Cushions</p></a><a class='cat' href='/shop.html'><div class='thumb t5'></div><p>Blankets &amp; Towels</p></a><a class='cat' href='/wholesale.html'><div class='thumb t6'></div><p>Studio Bulk Packs</p></a></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap'><div class='sec-head'><h2>This week's best sellers</h2><p>Over 1,000,000 mats and props shipped since 1999.</p></div><div class='grid g4'><div class='card prod'><div class='thumb t1'><span class='pill'>★ #1 Seller</span></div><h3>1/4&quot; Deluxe Sticky Yoga Mat</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ 4.8 <span>(2,140)</span></div><div class='price'>$24.95<span class='was'>$32.95</span><span class='save'>-24%</span></div><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Add to Cart</a><div class='stock'>In stock · 14 colors</div></div><div class='card prod'><div class='thumb t3'><span class='pill'>Studio favorite</span></div><h3>Foam Yoga Block 4&quot;x6&quot;x9&quot;</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ 4.9 <span>(1,806)</span></div><div class='price'>$8.95<span class='was'>$12.95</span><span class='save'>-31%</span></div><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Add to Cart</a><div class='stock'>Buy 6+ and save 10%</div></div><div class='card prod'><div class='thumb t4'></div><h3>8ft Cotton Strap with D-Ring</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★☆ 4.7 <span>(944)</span></div><div class='price'>$9.95<span class='was'>$13.95</span><span class='save'>-29%</span></div><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Add to Cart</a><div class='stock'>In stock · 8 colors</div></div><div class='card prod'><div class='thumb t2'><span class='pill'>Low stock</span></div><h3>Rectangular Cotton Bolster</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ 4.9 <span>(613)</span></div><div class='price'>$44.95<span class='was'>$54.95</span><span class='save'>-18%</span></div><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Add to Cart</a><div class='stock'>Only 23 left in this color</div></div></div><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:26px'><a class='btn btn-2' href='/shop.html'>See all 60+ products →</a></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap grid g2' style='align-items:center'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Bundle &amp; save</div><h2>Complete Practice Kit — $39.95</h2><p class='lede'>Deluxe 1/4&quot; sticky mat + foam block + 8ft cotton strap. Everything a new student needs, <strong>$12 less</strong> than buying separately. The #1 choice for teacher trainings and new-member welcome gifts.</p><div class='cta-row'><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Add Kit to Cart – $39.95</a><a class='btn btn-o' href='/wholesale.html'>Need 20+ kits?</a></div><p class='fine' style='color:#41504f'>Ships free with any $75+ order · 60-day returns</p></div><div class='grid g3'><div class='thumb t1' style='height:130px'></div><div class='thumb t3' style='height:130px'></div><div class='thumb t4' style='height:130px'></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='sec-head'><h2>Outfitting a studio, school or event?</h2><p>Tiered pricing kicks in automatically at 6 units — no application, no minimums, no membership fee. Need 100+? We'll quote you direct from the factory.</p></div><div class='grid g2' style='align-items:start'><table class='tier'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Your discount</th><th>Example: Deluxe Mat</th></tr><tr><td>1–5 units</td><td>—</td><td>$24.95 ea</td></tr><tr><td>6–11 units</td><td>10% off</td><td>$22.45 ea</td></tr><tr><td>12–35 units</td><td>15% off</td><td>$21.20 ea</td></tr><tr><td>36–99 units</td><td>20% off</td><td>$19.95 ea</td></tr><tr><td>100+ units</td><td>Custom quote + free freight</td><td>Call us</td></tr></table><div><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;We re-matted all three of our studios with YogaDirect and saved over $2,300 versus our old supplier. Same mats our students already loved.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Dana R., owner, 3-studio group, Austin TX</cite></div><div class='cta-row'><a class='btn' href='/wholesale.html'>Request a Bulk Quote →</a><a class='btn btn-o' href='tel:18005550199'>Call (800) 555-0199</a></div><p class='fine' style='color:#41504f'>Most quotes returned the same business day. Purchase orders and net-30 terms available for schools, gyms and government buyers.</p></div></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><div class='sec-head'><h2>Loved by teachers since 1999</h2></div><div class='grid g3'><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;These mats have survived four years of hot classes and 20 washes. Unbeatable for the price.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Marisol P., verified buyer</cite></div><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;Ordered 40 blocks on Tuesday, they were on the studio floor Thursday. Zero drama.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Kevin L., studio manager</cite></div><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;I've bought from the big brands. Same feel, roughly half the price, and a real human answers the phone.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Alicia W., RYT-500</cite></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='email'><h2 style='color:#fff'>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p>Join 85,000+ practitioners for restock alerts, teacher-only deals and new-product early access.</p><form data-ajax><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn' type='submit'>Send My 10% Code</button></form><p class='fine'>One email a week, unsubscribe anytime. Code works on your first order, sitewide.</p></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:900px'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Questions before you order?</h2><div style='margin-top:20px'><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>How fast will my order ship? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>In-stock orders placed by 2pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse; everything else ships within 1 business day. Standard delivery is 2–5 business days. Free shipping on orders over $75.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>What if the mat isn't right for me? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Return any unused item within 60 days for a full refund — no restocking fee. If a product fails in normal use, contact us and we'll make it right.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Do I need an account or application for wholesale pricing? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>No. Discounts of 10–20% apply automatically at 6, 12 and 36 units. For 100+ units, custom colors, private labeling or freight quotes, <a href='/wholesale.html' style='color:#0f5e5c;font-weight:700'>request a quote</a> and we'll usually reply the same day.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Are your mats latex-free and non-toxic? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Our standard sticky mats are PVC-based, latex-free and phthalate-free (6P). We also carry TPE, natural rubber and cork options — spec sheets available on request for schools and institutional buyers.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Can I pay by purchase order? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Yes. Schools, universities, hospitals, military bases and municipalities can order on PO with net-30 terms. Email po@yogadirect.com or call (800) 555-0199.</div></div></div><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:30px'><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Start Shopping →</a></div></div></section><footer class='ftr'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g4'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'><span class='logo-mark'>▲</span> Yoga<b>Direct</b></div><p style='margin-top:12px'>Supplying the yoga community with mats and props direct from the maker since 1999.</p><p><a href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm ET<br><a href='mailto:help@yogadirect.com'>help@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html'>All Products</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li