q-a{display:none;padding:0 0 16px;color:#41504f}.faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.ftr{background:#12201f;color:#cfd9d8;padding:46px 0 28px;font-size:14.5px}.ftr h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}.ftr ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.ftr-bot{border-top:1px solid #2a3937;margin-top:26px;padding-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-size:13px}.mbar{display:none}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:31px}.hero-in{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{display:none}.nav.open{display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:absolute;top:70px;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ded3}.burger{display:block}.ph{display:none}.g4,.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:700px){.g2,.g3,.g4,.form .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}body{padding-bottom:74px}.mbar{display:flex;position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;gap:8px;padding:10px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e5ded3;z-index:60}.mbar .btn{flex:1;padding:13px}}</style></head><body><div class='bar'>Same-day bulk quotes &nbsp;·&nbsp; Free freight on qualifying 100+ unit orders &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>PO &amp; net-30 welcome</b></div><header class='hdr'><div class='wrap hdr-in'><a class='logo' href='/index.html'><span class='logo-mark'>▲</span> Yoga<b>Direct</b></a><nav class='nav' id='nav'><a href='/shop.html'>Shop All</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Wholesale</a><a href='/about.html'>Why Us</a><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></nav><div class='hdr-cta'><a class='ph' href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><a class='btn btn-sm' href='#quote'>Get a Quote</a><button class='burger' aria-label='Menu'>☰</button></div></div></header><div class='hero'><div class='wrap hero-in'><div><div class='eyebrow'>Wholesale · Studios · Schools · Events</div><h1>Outfit your whole floor for less — direct from the manufacturer</h1><p class='lede'>Since 1999 we've supplied mats and props to thousands of studios, schools, gyms, hotels, retreats and corporate wellness programs. Because we manufacture and source our own goods, you skip the distributor markup entirely.</p><ul class='ticks'><li>10–20% off automatically at 6, 12 and 36 units — no application needed</li><li>Custom quotes, custom colors and private label on 100+ units</li><li>Purchase orders &amp; net-30 terms for schools, gyms and government</li><li>In-stock orders ship in 1 business day from our US warehouse</li><li>A dedicated rep who answers the phone — not a ticket queue</li></ul><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px'><a class='btn btn-2' href='tel:18005550199'>Call (800) 555-0199</a><a class='btn btn-o' href='/shop.html'>Browse Products</a></div></div><div class='form' id='quote'><h2 style='font-size:24px'>Get your bulk quote today</h2><p class='fine'>Most quotes are returned the same business day. No obligation, no account required.</p><form data-ajax><div class='row'><div><label>First name</label><input required placeholder='Jane'></div><div><label>Last name</label><input required placeholder='Doe'></div></div><div class='row'><div><label>Work email</label><input type='email' required placeholder='jane@studio.com'></div><div><label>Phone</label><input type='tel' placeholder='(555) 123-4567'></div></div><label>Organization</label><input placeholder='Studio, school, gym, hotel, event...'><div class='row'><div><label>I'm buying for</label><select><option>Yoga studio</option><option>School / university</option><option>Gym / health club</option><option>Hotel / spa / resort</option><option>Event or retreat</option><option>Corporate wellness</option><option>Reseller / retailer</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div><label>Approx. quantity</label><select><option>6–11 units</option><option>12–35 units</option><option>36–99 units</option><option>100–499 units</option><option>500+ units</option></select></div></div><label>What do you need?</label><textarea rows='3' placeholder='e.g. 60 x 1/4in mats in charcoal, 30 blocks, delivery by Oct 1'></textarea><button class='btn' type='submit'>Send My Quote Request →</button><p class='fine' style='margin-top:10px;text-align:center'>🔒 We never share your info. Prefer to talk? Call (800) 555-0199, Mon–Fri 9–6 ET.</p></form></div></div></div><section><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Volume pricing at a glance</h2><p style='text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 26px'>Discounts stack across your cart — mix mats, blocks, straps and bolsters to hit the next tier.</p><div class='grid g2' style='align-items:start'><table class='tier'><tr><th>Quantity (mixed OK)</th><th>Discount</th><th>Deluxe Mat price</th></tr><tr><td>1–5 units</td><td>—</td><td>$24.95 ea</td></tr><tr><td>6–11 units</td><td>10% off</td><td>$22.45 ea</td></tr><tr><td>12–35 units</td><td>15% off</td><td>$21.20 ea</td></tr><tr><td>36–99 units</td><td>20% off</td><td>$19.95 ea</td></tr><tr><td>100+ units</td><td>Custom + free freight</td><td>Request quote</td></tr></table><div class='grid' style='gap:14px'><div class='card'><h3>Typical studio re-fit</h3><p style='margin:0'>40 mats + 40 blocks + 20 straps at the 20% tier ≈ <strong>$1,196 total</strong> — roughly <strong>$430 less</strong> than big-brand retail, delivered in under a week.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>What you can customize on 100+</h3><p style='margin:0'>Colors, thickness, mat length, logo printing, private-label packaging, and blanket-order releases so you store less inventory.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>How to order</h3><p style='margin:0'>Order online at tier pricing, or send us a request and we'll build the quote, confirm stock and freight, and invoice on your terms.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Trusted by the people who teach every day</h2><div class='grid g3' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;We re-matted all three of our studios and saved over $2,300 versus our old supplier. Same mats our students already loved.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Dana R., owner, 3-studio group, Austin TX</cite></div><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;Ordered 40 blocks on Tuesday, they were on the studio floor Thursday. My rep even flagged a better price tier.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Kevin L., studio manager, Chicago</cite></div><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;Our district bought 120 mats on a purchase order with net-30. Spec sheets came the same day I asked.&rdquo;</p><cite>— T. Nguyen, PE coordinator</cite></div></div><div class='grid g4' style='margin-top:26px;text-align:center;font-weight:700'><div class='card'>25+ years supplying yoga</div><div class='card'>1,000,000+ mats shipped</div><div class='card'>4.8/5 · 12,000+ reviews</div><div class='card'>Ships in 1 business day</div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap' style='max-width:900px'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Wholesale FAQ</h2><div style='margin-top:18px'><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Is there a minimum order or application? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>No application and no membership fee. Tier discounts start at just 6 units and apply automatically. For custom pricing on 100+ units, simply request a quote.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>How fast can you ship a large order? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>In-stock bulk orders typically leave our US warehouse within 1 business day, with delivery in 2–5 business days. Palletized freight orders are usually scheduled within 48 hours. Tell us your deadline and we'll confirm before you buy.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Do you accept purchase orders? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Yes — schools, universities, hospitals, military bases, municipalities and established studios can order on PO with net-30 terms. Email po@yogadirect.com or note it in your quote request.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Can I get samples before committing? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Absolutely. We'll send a sample of any mat or prop before a large order, and sample costs are credited back on qualifying purchases.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Can you print our studio logo? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Yes. Logo printing and private-label packaging are available on qualifying quantities — a popular add-on for retail resale, member gifts and corporate events.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>What if something arrives damaged? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Send a photo within 30 days and we'll replace it or refund it. Unused items can be returned within 60 days with no restocking fee.</div></div></div><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:30px'><a class='btn' href='#quote'>Request My Bulk Quote →</a><p class='fine' style='margin-top:10px'>Or call (800) 555-0199 — Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm ET</p></div></div></section><footer class='ftr'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g4'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'><span class='logo-mark'>▲</span> Yoga<b>Direct</b></div><p style='margin-top:12px'>Mats and props direct from the maker since 1999.</p><p><a href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><br><a href='mailto:wholesale@yogadirect.com'>wholesale@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html'>All Products</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; Government</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Private Label</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='ftr-bot'><span>© 1999–2024 YogaDirect.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Purchase orders</span></div></div></footer><div class='mbar'><a class='btn btn-o' href='tel:18005550199'>Call Us</a><a class='btn' href='#quote'>Get a Quote</a></div><script>var b=document.querySelector('.burger');if(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){document.getElementById('nav').classList.toggle('open')})}document.querySelectorAll('.faq-q').forEach(function(q){q.addEventListener('click',function(){q.parentNode.classList.toggle('open')})});document.querySelectorAll('form[data-ajax]').forEach(function(f){f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();f.innerHTML='<div class=ok>Thanks — your request is in. A YogaDirect specialist will email your quote within one business day (usually same day). Need it faster? Call (800) 555-0199.</div>'})})</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/about.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Why YogaDirect | Manufacturer-Direct Yoga Gear Since 1999</title><meta name='description' content='YogaDirect has supplied the yoga community since 1999. We manufacture and source our own mats and props, so you get high-quality gear at manufacturer-direct prices.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d2b2b;background:#fff;line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 12px}h1{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-1px}h2{font-size:30px}p{margin:0 0 16px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.narrow{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto}.bar{background:#0f5e5c;color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px}.bar b{background:#e0663a;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;margin:0 4px}.hdr{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ded3}.hdr-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;height:70px}.logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.logo-mark{color:#e0663a}.nav{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-left:auto;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.hdr-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.ph{font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#0f5e5c;white-space:nowrap}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#e0663a;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:8px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;text-align:center}.btn:hover{background:#c8542b}.btn-sm{padding:10px 16px;font-size:14px}.btn-2{background:#0f5e5c}.btn-o{background:#fff;color:#0f5e5c;border:2px solid #0f5e5c}.burger{display:none;background:none;border:0;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer}section{padding:52px 0}.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f3ec,#fff);padding:46px 0 34px}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f5e5c;margin-bottom:10px}.lede{font-size:19px;color:#41504f}.grid{display:grid;gap:20px}.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.card{border:1px solid #e5ded3;border-radius:14px;padding:22px;background:#fff}.card h3{font-size:19px}.band{background:#f7f3ec}.stat{text-align:center}.stat b{display:block;font-size:34px;color:#0f5e5c;letter-spacing:-1px}.quote{background:#fff;border-left:4px solid #0f5e5c;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0}.quote cite{font-size:13.5px;color:#5c6b6a;font-style:normal;font-weight:700}.cta{background:#0f5e5c;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;text-align:center}.ftr{background:#12201f;color:#cfd9d8;padding:46px 0 28px;font-size:14.5px}.ftr h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}.ftr ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.ftr-bot{border-top:1px solid #2a3937;margin-top:26px;padding-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-size:13px}.mbar{display:none}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:31px}.nav{display:none}.nav.open{display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:absolute;top:70px;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ded3}.burger{display:block}.ph{display:none}.g4,.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:700px){.g2,.g3,.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr}body{padding-bottom:74px}.mbar{display:flex;position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;gap:8px;padding:10px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e5ded3;z-index:60}.mbar .btn{flex:1;padding:13px}}</style></head><body><div class='bar'>FREE shipping over $75 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 10% off your first order with code <b>WELCOME10</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Bulk pricing from 6 units</div><header class='hdr'><div class='wrap hdr-in'><a class='logo' href='/index.html'><span class='logo-mark'>▲</span> Yoga<b>Direct</b></a><nav class='nav' id='nav'><a href='/shop.html'>Shop All</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Wholesale</a><a href='/about.html'>Why Us</a><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></nav><div class='hdr-cta'><a class='ph' href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><a class='btn btn-sm' href='/shop.html'>Shop Now</a><button class='burger' aria-label='Menu'>☰</button></div></div></header><div class='hero'><div class='wrap narrow'><div class='eyebrow'>Our story</div><h1>Serving the yoga community since 1999</h1><p class='lede'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We've been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999 — and we're confident we can help you grow your studio, event or personal practice with everything you need and more.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap'><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Shop Best Sellers</a><a class='btn btn-o' href='/wholesale.html'>Get Bulk Pricing</a></div></div></div><section style='padding-top:34px'><div class='wrap grid g4'><div class='card stat'><b>25+</b>years serving yoga</div><div class='card stat'>b<b>1M+</b>mats &amp; props shipped</div><div class='card stat'><b>4.8/5</b>from 12,000+ reviews</div><div class='card stat'><b>1 day</b>typical ship time</div></div></section><section style='padding-top:10px'><div class='wrap narrow'><h2>Why our prices are lower</h2><p>We manufacture and source our own goods. That means no distributor in the middle, no licensing fees, and no marketing budget baked into the price of your mat. It's how we consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices — the same gear you'll find on studio floors across the country.</p><p>When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice, but the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you: thank you.</p></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>What you get with every order</h2><div class='grid g3' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='card'><h3>🏭 Manufacturer-direct pricing</h3><p style='margin:0'>We own the supply chain, so you pay for the product — not the middlemen.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>🚚 Fast, honest shipping</h3><p style='margin:0'>In-stock orders ship within 1 business day from our US warehouse. Free over $75.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>↩️ 60-day returns</h3><p style='margin:0'>Unused items come back for a full refund. No restocking fees, no runaround.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>🧾 Built for bulk buyers</h3><p style='margin:0'>Automatic 10–20% volume discounts, custom quotes on 100+, POs and net-30 terms.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>📞 Real humans</h3><p style='margin:0'>Call (800) 555-0199 and talk to someone who knows the products and your deadline.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>🧘 Made for real practice</h3><p style='margin:0'>Latex-free mats, sustainable cork and TPE options, spec sheets available on request.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>In the words of our customers</h2><div class='grid g3' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;These mats have survived four years of hot classes and 20 washes. Unbeatable for the price.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Marisol P., verified buyer</cite></div><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;We saved over $2,300 re-matting three studios, and my students didn't notice a thing — except the new colors.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Dana R., studio owner</cite></div><div class='quote'><p>&ldquo;I've bought from the big brands. Same feel, roughly half the price, and a real human answers the phone.&rdquo;</p><cite>— Alicia W., RYT-500</cite></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap'><div class='cta'><h2 style='color:#fff'>Ready when you are</h2><p style='max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 18px'>Shop 60+ in-stock mats and props, or tell us what your studio needs and we'll quote it today.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap'><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Shop Products →</a><a class='btn btn-o' href='/wholesale.html'>Request a Bulk Quote</a></div></div></div></section><footer class='ftr'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g4'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'><span class='logo-mark'>▲</span> Yoga<b>Direct</b></div><p style='margin-top:12px'>Mats and props direct from the maker since 1999.</p><p><a href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><br><a href='mailto:help@yogadirect.com'>help@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html'>All Products</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; Government</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='ftr-bot'><span>© 1999–2024 YogaDirect.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Purchase orders</span></div></div></footer><div class='mbar'><a class='btn btn-o' href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Quote</a><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Shop Now</a></div><script>var b=document.querySelector('.burger');if(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){document.getElementById('nav').classList.toggle('open')})}</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/faq.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Shipping, Returns &amp; FAQ | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='YogaDirect shipping times, free shipping over $75, 60-day returns with no restocking fees, bulk discount tiers, purchase orders and product specs.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d2b2b;background:#fff;line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 12px}h1{font-size:40px;letter-spacing:-1px}h2{font-size:26px}p{margin:0 0 14px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.narrow{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}.bar{background:#0f5e5c;color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px}.bar b{background:#e0663a;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;margin:0 4px}.hdr{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ded3}.hdr-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;height:70px}.logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.logo-mark{color:#e0663a}.nav{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-left:auto;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.hdr-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.ph{font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#0f5e5c;white-space:nowrap}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#e0663a;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:8px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;text-align:center}.btn:hover{background:#c8542b}.btn-sm{padding:10px 16px;font-size:14px}.btn-2{background:#0f5e5c}.btn-o{background:#fff;color:#0f5e5c;border:2px solid #0f5e5c}.burger{display:none;background:none;border:0;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer}section{padding:44px 0}.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f3ec,#fff);padding:40px 0 30px}.grid{display:grid;gap:18px}.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.card{border:1px solid #e5ded3;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;background:#fff}.card h3{font-size:18px}.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid #e5ded3}.faq-q{width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;padding:18px 0;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.faq-a{display:none;padding:0 0 16px;color:#41504f}.faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.cta{background:#0f5e5c;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px;text-align:center}.ftr{background:#12201f;color:#cfd9d8;padding:46px 0 28px;font-size:14.5px}.ftr h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}.ftr ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:8px}.ftr-bot{border-top:1px solid #2a3937;margin-top:26px;padding-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-size:13px}.mbar{display:none}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:30px}.nav{display:none}.nav.open{display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:absolute;top:70px;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ded3}.burger{display:block}.ph{display:none}.g3,.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:700px){.g3,.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr}body{padding-bottom:74px}.mbar{display:flex;position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;gap:8px;padding:10px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #e5ded3;z-index:60}.mbar .btn{flex:1;padding:13px}}</style></head><body><div class='bar'>FREE shipping over $75 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 60-day returns, no restocking fees &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>Ships in 1 business day</b></div><header class='hdr'><div class='wrap hdr-in'><a class='logo' href='/index.html'><span class='logo-mark'>▲</span> Yoga<b>Direct</b></a><nav class='nav' id='nav'><a href='/shop.html'>Shop All</a><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Wholesale</a><a href='/about.html'>Why Us</a><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></nav><div class='hdr-cta'><a class='ph' href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><a class='btn btn-sm' href='/shop.html'>Shop Now</a><button class='burger' aria-label='Menu'>☰</button></div></div></header><div class='hero'><div class='wrap narrow'><h1>Shipping, returns &amp; answers</h1><p style='font-size:18px;color:#41504f'>Everything you need to know before you order. Still stuck? Call <a href='tel:18005550199' style='color:#0f5e5c;font-weight:700'>(800) 555-0199</a> Mon–Fri 9am–6pm ET, or email <a href='mailto:help@yogadirect.com' style='color:#0f5e5c;font-weight:700'>help@yogadirect.com</a>.</p></div></div><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap grid g4'><div class='card'><h3>🚚 Free over $75</h3><p style='margin:0'>Flat $6.95 standard shipping under $75 in the contiguous US.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>⏱️ Ships in 1 day</h3><p style='margin:0'>Order by 2pm ET and in-stock items usually leave the same day.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>↩️ 60-day returns</h3><p style='margin:0'>Unused items, full refund, no restocking fee.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>🧾 POs accepted</h3><p style='margin:0'>Net-30 terms for schools, gyms and government buyers.</p></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap narrow'><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div style='margin-top:14px'><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>How much is shipping and when will my order arrive? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Standard shipping is $6.95 in the contiguous US and free on orders over $75. In-stock items placed by 2pm ET typically ship the same business day, otherwise within 1 business day. Transit is normally 2–5 business days. Expedited and freight options are available at checkout or by phone. AK/HI and international rates are quoted at checkout.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>What is your return policy? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Return any unused item within 60 days of delivery for a full refund of the product price — no restocking fee. Just contact us for a return authorization. If a product fails in normal use, or arrives damaged, send a photo within 30 days and we'll replace or refund it.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Do I get a discount for buying multiples? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Yes, and you don't need an account: 10% off at 6–11 units, 15% off at 12–35 units, 20% off at 36–99 units. Quantities can be mixed across products. For 100+ units, custom colors or private label, <a href='/wholesale.html' style='color:#0f5e5c;font-weight:700'>request a bulk quote</a> — most come back the same business day.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Which mat should I choose? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Our 1/4&quot; Deluxe Sticky Mat is the all-round favorite for studios and home practice — grippy, cushioned and easy to clean. Choose the 6mm Studio Pro TPE mat if you want a lighter, latex-free eco option, and add a non-slip towel for hot classes. Not sure? Call us and we'll match a mat to your style and floor.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Are your products latex-free or eco-friendly? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Our standard sticky mats are PVC-based, latex-free and phthalate-free (6P compliant). We also carry TPE, natural rubber and cork options. Spec and compliance sheets are available on request for schools and institutional buyers.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>How do I clean my mat? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Wipe with a mild soap-and-water solution or a diluted vinegar spray, then air dry flat or hung. Avoid direct sun and high heat drying. Cotton straps, blankets and bolster covers are machine washable in cold water.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Can I order by phone or purchase order? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Yes. Call (800) 555-0199 Mon–Fri 9am–6pm ET to order by phone. Schools, universities, hospitals, military bases and municipalities can order on PO with net-30 terms — email po@yogadirect.com.</div></div><div class='faq-item'><button class='faq-q'>Is checkout secure? <span>+</span></button><div class='faq-a'>Yes. Checkout is encrypted end to end and we accept Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Discover, PayPal and purchase orders. We never store full card numbers or share your information.</div></div></div><div style='margin-top:34px'><div class='cta'><h2 style='color:#fff'>Got what you needed?</h2><p style='margin:0 auto 18px;max-width:520px'>Shop 60+ in-stock mats and props, or get a same-day quote for your studio.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap'><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Shop Now →</a><a class='btn btn-o' href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk Quote</a></div></div></div></div></section><footer class='ftr'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid g4'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'><span class='logo-mark'>▲</span> Yoga<b>Direct</b></div><p style='margin-top:12px'>Mats and props direct from the maker since 1999.</p><p><a href='tel:18005550199'>☎ (800) 555-0199</a><br><a href='mailto:help@yogadirect.com'>help@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html'>All Products</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Buy in bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio &amp; Wholesale</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; Government</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/faq.html'>Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href='/about.html'>About Us</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='ftr-bot'><span>© 1999–2024 YogaDirect.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Purchase orders</span></div></div></footer><div class='mbar'><a class='btn btn-o' href='tel:18005550199'>Call Us</a><a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Shop Now</a></div><script>var b=document.querySelector('.burger');if(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){document.getElementById('nav').classList.toggle('open')})}document.querySelectorAll('.faq-q').forEach(function(q){q.addEventListener('click',function(){q.parentNode.classList.toggle('open')})})</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/contact.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Contact YogaDirect | Talk to a Real Yoga Gear Specialist</title><meta name='description' content='Call (800) 555-0199 or message the YogaDirect team for product help, order status, bulk quotes and purchase orders. Mon-Fri 9am-6pm ET.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d2b2b;background:#fff;line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 12px}h1{font-size:40px;letter-spacing:-1px}h2{font-size:26px}p{margin:0 0 14px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.bar{background:#0f5e5c;color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px}.bar b{background:#e0663a;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;margin:0 4px}.hdr{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ded3}.hdr-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;height:70px}.logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.logo-mark{color:#e0663a}.nav{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-left:auto;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.hdr-cta{display:flex;a