egory tiles linking to the shop page, and a best-sellers section with pricing and rating details for four products.\n\nBeyond that I'm sketching a bundle offer, wholesale tier table, testimonials, email capture, a short FAQ, footer, and sticky mobile CTA — then planning the remaining pages: shop.html with filters and bulk packs, wholesale.html with a quote form and studio testimonials, about.html with company history and guarantees, faq.html with an accordion, and contact.html with a form and hours, all kept to a moderate length.\n\nNow I'm drafting the shared CSS reset and base styles, along with visual product thumbnails styled with different gradient classes, and button microcopy showing prices.\n\nStill writing styles...\n\nAdding button and nav styles...\n\nAdding sticky mobile bottom bar styles...\n\nRounding out the list with a yoga wheel, non-slip towel, wedge, and mat storage sling, then noting the wholesale discount tiers ranging from 10% off for 6-11 units up to 20% off for 36-99, with custom pricing for 100+. Ready to write the response now.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":2,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5717,"completion_tokens":41737,"total_tokens":47454,"cost":1.07201,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":1.07201,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.028585,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":1.043425},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":4595,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
